{"version":1,"content":"<p>前無綫（TVB）藝人夏竹欣（Joe）自2015年離巢後轉投保險界發展，轉眼間已踏入第11個年頭。</p><p>當年她憑藉《衝上雲霄II》中飛行學員「明日夢（Win）」一角為觀眾熟知，如今已成功褪去綠葉標籤，蛻變成獨當一面的業界女強人。</p><p>近日，她在社交平台報</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:16:18.283724+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:28.165352+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:28.165352+00:00","content_hash":"af490f9ef1462662d4b9149b33eb594b0d9d875b6e8e5a83ab792f37811ff18c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}